		"description": "<p>As a Mystic Champion, you gain magical training at 3rd level, though it is fairly rudimentary. You may choose to gain either the Arcane Knight or Eldritch Blackguard combat tradition and immediately choose one maneuver from the tradition. You’ll gain an additional maneuver from your chosen tradition at levels 6, 9, 13, and 18.</p><p>These additional maneuvers do not count against your maneuvers known on the champion table.</p>",
